Sj1?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ew27g/works/47", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/aad94c65/uploads/origins/760b68d3-c283-4ecc-a6bf-3ea93e4178dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5910bdcfcff4006782c54fd5b72e694f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aad94c65/uploads/origins/760b68d3-c283-4ecc-a6bf-3ea93e4178dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5910bdcfcff4006782c54fd5b72e694f, https://si.imgix.net/aad94c65/uploads/origins/760b68d3-c283-4ecc-a6bf-3ea93e4178dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c45968b8bf152a739c3e5f238362c7f4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aad94c65/uploads/origins/760b68d3-c283-4ecc-a6bf-3ea93e4178dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=32463cc11a6e4673a03109ff26f36021 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Im so sorry, I am back! I love your art so much, I'd love to get ANOTHER drawing of myself!\n\nId like to get my Demonshii design and I'd like the outfit to be kiryu from the Yakuza series! And I’d also like to be holding a plushie from the series called bun-Chan!\n\nKiryu: https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/jerma-lore/images/a/a7/Kazuma_Y0.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20220228235025\n\nBun-chan: https://steamuserimages-a.akamaihd.net/ugc/1330201629069218234/9975CD91048E209237548FF182EED86F98E77AD0/?imw=637&imh=358&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=true\n\n\nI'd love to have her to also have sunglasses on! Thank you so much! \n\ncharacter reference: https://sta.sh/21mpdoyudllw?edit=1\n\n\nThank you so much again for considering!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ew27g/works/46", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/44e5a041/uploads/origins/d85d0017-409e-47c4-bf2b-b5e42184c12b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=741f26000ee61ce4fd041d7784e3f0e2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/44e5a041/uploads/origins/d85d0017-409e-47c4-bf2b-b5e42184c12b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=741f26000ee61ce4fd041d7784e3f0e2, https://si.imgix.net/44e5a041/uploads/origins/d85d0017-409e-47c4-bf2b-b5e42184c12b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b39314e201bfc4d432f6dc4d4278e83 2x, https://si.imgix.net/44e5a041/uploads/origins/d85d0017-409e-47c4-bf2b-b5e42184c12b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df45bfac0adcc88d1dcb90691f693e6a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして！\n絵柄が好みだったので、オリキャラを描いていただきたいです。\nまた、SNSでの公開、アイコン使用許可をいただきたいです！\n(依頼アカウントとは別に@moniumu_allのアカウントでもイラストをアップさせてください！)\n\nもしよろしければお任せで好きな服装を着せてください！\nカジュアルでもドレスでも、露出多めでも本当に何でも大丈夫です！\n(そのままの服装でも大丈夫です！)\nポーズや構図はお任せいたします！\n\n◆キャラ資料\nhttps://twitter.com/moniumu_all/status/1619665581191610369?s=20\nhttps://twitter.com/moniumu_all/status/1619665449410756609?s=20\n\n▼分かりづらい要素\n・耳について\n耳は人間の耳がついてます。\nケモの耳っぽいのは、髪の毛でやっております。\n\n・足について\n靴で隠れているため見えないですが、足も手と同様黒っぽくなって爪が鋭くなってます。\n\n以上、ご検討よろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ew27g/works/45", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dfef4204/uploads/origins/b37c40ca-272d-4a18-b9d7-e32245e4089f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ccf33b1e7147b7d7ec93a983c794677", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dfef4204/uploads/origins/b37c40ca-272d-4a18-b9d7-e32245e4089f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ccf33b1e7147b7d7ec93a983c794677, https://si.imgix.net/dfef4204/uploads/origins/b37c40ca-272d-4a18-b9d7-e32245e4089f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bfd94cafa6c6dec2e7e919ff59e04b4c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dfef4204/uploads/origins/b37c40ca-272d-4a18-b9d7-e32245e4089f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=221523e240fd949a7